-- src:1958 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm và chỉ thanh toán cho Bên mua bảo hiểm Giá trị tài khoản sau khi trừ đi
-- src:1959 | các Khoản nợ, nếu có, và Hợp đồng bảo hiểm chấm dứt hiệu lực.
-- 22.3: the steps open to the Company when the insured no longer resides in Vietnam. The
-- clause gives no criteria for choosing among them (finding FD18).
@ref V082021 22.3 (src:1944-1959)
GIVEN `the insured no longer resides in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `A step open to the Company under 22.3`
`22.3 — the steps open to the Company, the insured no longer residing in Vietnam` `the insured no longer resides in Vietnam` MEANS
    IF   `the insured no longer resides in Vietnam`
    THEN LIST `raise the cost of insurance or the basic premium`,
              `reduce the sum insured`,
              `cancel the supplementary products`,
              `end the contract, paying the account value less the debts`
    ELSE EMPTY

