GIVEN `required or approved in writing by a competent state authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`22.5 — the Company may change a term of the contract, the change being required or approved by the authority` `required or approved in writing by a competent state authority` MEANS
    `required or approved in writing by a competent state authority`

§§ `Article 23 — Misstatement of age or sex`

